# Samsung touchscreen firmware blobs that CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE wants
# embedded into the kernel image. LineageOS ships them via the Android
# vendor firmware partition at runtime; Droidian's kernel-deb embeds them
# directly, so they need to be in-tree.
